+
+    <h2>Analytics, advertising, and fonts</h2>
+    <p>The shared page layout does not load analytics or advertising scripts, contact external font services, or create analytics consent records. These optional services are disabled by default. The site uses fonts available on your device.</p>
+
+    <h2>Reading list and browser storage</h2>
+    <p>The application does not initialize a reading-list session merely because you visit a page. When you save an article, its identifier is stored in a server-side session associated with a session cookie, where session support is available. It is used to display your saved articles. Remove articles through the reading-list panel; clearing the site's cookies disconnects your browser from that session but does not itself delete server-side data. The server-side retention period depends on the deployment's session configuration.</p>
+
+    <h2>Page requests and embedded content</h2>
+    <p>The hosting service receives connection details needed to deliver pages, such as your IP address and request information. Hosting log retention depends on the deployment and is not specified in this repository. Some articles include externally hosted images; requesting them shares connection information with that image host. Pages use a no-referrer policy to avoid sending the page address with outgoing requests.</p>
+    <p>Some demonstration articles contain their own interactive scripts, including a cookie-based plant statistics example. Disabling analytics in the shared layout does not disable these article demonstrations. You can clear site data through your browser settings.</p>
+    <p>See the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}legal/imprint`}>Imprint</a> for information about this demo. No verified privacy contact or account deletion service is provided by this application.</p>
